@*
    Client-side (unobtrusive) validation: instant per-field messages driven by the
    data-val-* attributes that asp-for tag helpers emit from model annotations.
    This is a convenience layer ONLY — the server re-validates everything
    (ModelState + service rules), so stripping these scripts or editing the DOM
    via dev tools cannot bypass validation.
*@
<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation/dist/jquery.validate.min.js"></script>
<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation-unobtrusive/dist/jquery.validate.unobtrusive.min.js"></script>
